initializing and configuring the source, add it to a map view’s style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"using the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle\/addSource:","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" method."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The URL may be a full HTTP or HTTPS URL or canonical URL. The URL should"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"point to a JSON file that conforms to the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"TileJSON specification"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If a Mapbox URL is specified, this source uses a tile size of 256. For all"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"other tilesets, the default value is 512. (See the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" documentation for more information about tile"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sizes.) If you need to use a tile size other than the default, use the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:tileSize:"},{"type":"text","text":" method."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Returns a raster tile source initialized with an identifier and configuration","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"URL.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"title":"initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:"}],"externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNRasterTileSource(im)initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterTileSource"]]},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize":{"title":"MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize","fragments":[{"text":"MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"code":"NSNumber","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" object containing a floating-point number that specifies the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"width and height (measured in points) at which the map displays each raster"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"image tile when the map’s zoom level is an integer. The raster tile source"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scales its images up or down when the map’s zoom level falls between two"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"integers."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlntilesourceoptiontilesize","type":"topic"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNRasterTileSource":{"title":"MLNRasterTileSource","fragments":[{"text":"MLNRasterTileSource","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterTileSource","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" is a map content source that supplies raster image tiles","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to be shown on the map. The location of and metadata about the tiles are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"defined either by an option dictionary or by an external file that conforms to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"TileJSON specification